  "description": {
    "text": "The Experience Battle at Battle Carnival 2012 Spring was a play area for young and first-time players, with a junior league and a parent-and-child league in which a parent and child played together with one deck, and loan decks of 30 and 60 cards. Everyone who played got an oversize jumbo Rayquaza, a card only ever printed in that size, and trying both deck sizes earned a set of basic Energy cards. It ran at every venue: Sendai, Yokohama, Nagoya and Osaka, May to June 2012.",
